1
00:00:00,854 --> 00:00:03,854
(Leonard:)Sheldon, we've been through this.
I'm taking Penny.

2
00:00:04,024 --> 00:00:06,194
(Sheldon:)Afraid not. Do you recognize this?

3
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:10,070
-Oh, not the roommate agreement.
-Indeed, the roommate agreement.

4
00:00:10,239 --> 00:00:12,909
(Sheldon:)I call your attention
to the Friendship Rider...

5
00:00:13,075 --> 00:00:15,535
...in Appendix C: Future Commitments.
Number 37:

6
00:00:15,702 --> 00:00:19,872
"In the event one friend is ever invited
to visit the Large Hadron Collider...

7
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:23,960
...now under construction, he shall invite
the other friend to accompany him."

8
00:00:24,128 --> 00:00:25,548
(Leonard:)Oh, for God's sakes.

9
00:00:26,755 --> 00:00:28,545
(Penny:)You actually put that
in an agreement?

10
00:00:28,715 --> 00:00:31,635
We put in what happens
if one of us wins a MacArthur Grant...

11
00:00:31,802 --> 00:00:36,392
(Leonard:)...or if one of us gets superpowers,
or if one of us is bitten by a zombie.

12
00:00:36,890 --> 00:00:39,640
(Sheldon:)He can't kill me. Even if I turn.

13
00:00:40,686 --> 00:00:43,436
Is there anything about
if one of you gets a girlfriend?

14
00:00:43,605 --> 00:00:45,895
(Sheldon:)No, that seemed a little far-fetched.

15
00:00:48,986 --> 00:00:51,696
(Leonard:)Sheldon, do you really expect
to enforce this?

16
00:00:51,864 --> 00:00:54,454
I've lived up to my commitments
under the agreement.

17
00:00:54,616 --> 00:00:59,026
(Sheldon:)At least once a day I ask how you are,
even though I simply don't care.

